{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Welcome To Everdell",
    "steam_appid": 2553410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/40afc486c207e110b8ec2aa406dc3549.webp?t=1737568008\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/d2f2a632a0eabb252472ef7f139d34f4.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span><br><strong>The parade is about to begin! I will give lots of shiny points to the critter with the best things that I like the most!</strong><br><br>Join Chip, Sweep, and the kids of <i>Everdell</i> to build the most spectacular make-believe city ever!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/7354d8f7419e0eeca019fb9660c1ff2d.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span><br>This easy-to-learn worker-placement and tableau-building board game gets the lil\u2019 ones' brains a buzzin\u2019. Climb across the rope bridge, watch out for the dragon\u2019s den, and join us in the fort for the latest addition to the award-winning <i>Everdell</i> line \u2013 perfect for kids and families!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><i>Welcome to Everdell</i> takes place over four rounds. We'll take turns sending our Friends around the forest to gather resources like <strong>berries</strong>, <strong>twigs</strong>, and <strong>resin</strong> that we'll use to play cards from our hand.<br><br>There are two types of cards \u2013 <strong>critters</strong> and <strong>places</strong>. In addition to scoring points, each card provides other rewards:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Green</strong> cards activate once as soon as you play them, and they activate again at the beginning of each new round.<br></li><li><strong>Blue</strong> cards activate after playing a certain card type or earning a Parade, or let you play a certain card for cheaper.<br></li><li><strong>Tan</strong> cards activate only one time as soon as you play them. They do not activate again.<br></li><li><strong>Red</strong> cards activate when you place a Friend on them. Each player may only use their own Red cards that they have played.<br></li><li><strong>Purple</strong> cards only activate after the game has ended. They give you point tokens for other cards or Parades you may have at the end of the game.</li></ul><br><strong>Parades</strong> are special point bonuses that you can earn by collecting different sets of cards. Each player can earn each parade once, and they're worth more points the sooner you get them, so go quick! There are four different types of parades:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Places<br></li><li>5 Critters<br></li><li>At least 1 of each colored symbol<br></li><li>3 cards of the same color (except Green)</li></ul><br>After four rounds, the game is over and we add up our points \u2013 whoever has built the best make-believe city wins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/67d4cc129030f22511bb9d834d5723a6.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/40afc486c207e110b8ec2aa406dc3549.webp?t=1737568008\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/d2f2a632a0eabb252472ef7f139d34f4.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span><br><strong>The parade is about to begin! I will give lots of shiny points to the critter with the best things that I like the most!</strong><br><br>Join Chip, Sweep, and the kids of <i>Everdell</i> to build the most spectacular make-believe city ever!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/7354d8f7419e0eeca019fb9660c1ff2d.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span><br>This easy-to-learn worker-placement and tableau-building board game gets the lil\u2019 ones' brains a buzzin\u2019. Climb across the rope bridge, watch out for the dragon\u2019s den, and join us in the fort for the latest addition to the award-winning <i>Everdell</i> line \u2013 perfect for kids and families!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><i>Welcome to Everdell</i> takes place over four rounds. We'll take turns sending our Friends around the forest to gather resources like <strong>berries</strong>, <strong>twigs</strong>, and <strong>resin</strong> that we'll use to play cards from our hand.<br><br>There are two types of cards \u2013 <strong>critters</strong> and <strong>places</strong>. In addition to scoring points, each card provides other rewards:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Green</strong> cards activate once as soon as you play them, and they activate again at the beginning of each new round.<br></li><li><strong>Blue</strong> cards activate after playing a certain card type or earning a Parade, or let you play a certain card for cheaper.<br></li><li><strong>Tan</strong> cards activate only one time as soon as you play them. They do not activate again.<br></li><li><strong>Red</strong> cards activate when you place a Friend on them. Each player may only use their own Red cards that they have played.<br></li><li><strong>Purple</strong> cards only activate after the game has ended. They give you point tokens for other cards or Parades you may have at the end of the game.</li></ul><br><strong>Parades</strong> are special point bonuses that you can earn by collecting different sets of cards. Each player can earn each parade once, and they're worth more points the sooner you get them, so go quick! There are four different types of parades:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Places<br></li><li>5 Critters<br></li><li>At least 1 of each colored symbol<br></li><li>3 cards of the same color (except Green)</li></ul><br>After four rounds, the game is over and we add up our points \u2013 whoever has built the best make-believe city wins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553410/extras/67d4cc129030f22511bb9d834d5723a6.avif?t=1737568008\" /></span>",
